::  name       mantra store dir count
::  shape      dirs - int (@u32)
::  invariant  a Store holds exactly three directory handles (root · mantra · blobs)
::  example    3
::  readers    Mantra · Glow Tend · Sur museum · Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e206-mantra-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e206 · Mantra M4 — fourth Mantra structure pedestal in src/sur/.
::  Names Store's directory count from mantra/src/store.rye: the repository
::  root, the .mantra/ tree, and .mantra/blobs/. Pedestal only; Rye still
::  owns open · put · get and the sha3 blob names.
+$  mantra-store-dir-count-shape
  $:  dirs=@u32
  ==
